.TH PLAYBIN 1 "August 2026" "playbin 2.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
playbin \- audio player and visualizer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B playbin
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B playbin
is a lightweight desktop audio player and visualizer built on top of
.BR mpv (1)
and
.BR yt-dlp (1).
It resolves a search query or URL to a playable stream and displays a
real-time frequency-band visualizer alongside standard playback controls.
.SH USAGE
On launch, playbin opens a window with a text entry field and a set of
controls.
.TP
.B Entry field
Type a search query or a direct URL and press
.B Enter
to play it.
.TP
.B Play
Resolves and plays the current entry field contents.
.TP
.B Stop
Stops playback and terminates the underlying mpv process.
.TP
.B Pause
Toggles playback between paused and playing. Can also be triggered by
pressing
.B Space
while the entry field is focused.
.TP
.B Video
Toggles whether video is rendered alongside audio, or audio-only playback
is used.
.TP
.B Loop
Toggles whether the current track repeats indefinitely once playback ends.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /tmp/mpvsocket
Unix domain socket used for IPC between playbin and the underlying mpv
process.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1),
.BR yt-dlp (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.UR https://github.com/satkarjuneja/playbin
.UE
